1. Morphicons
-------------

Files:

- `dashboard/src/lib/iconMorph.ts` — the pure icon-morph core.
- `dashboard/src/components/icons/MorphIcon.tsx` — the React driver.

Source: https://github.com/guillermolg00/morphicons

License: MIT

Copyright (c) 2026 Guillermo (guillermolg.com)

The core is adapted from Morphicons. The adaptation for APC uses a small list
of single-subpath `d` strings on a 24×24 grid instead of Lucide IconNodes,
pairs subpaths one-to-one by centroid and length, and collapses leftover
subpaths into a fading point instead of duplicating a target subpath. The MIT
license text is reproduced in `MorphIcon.tsx` and in the root LICENSE.

