3. DataV GeoAtlas-derived geography
-----------------------------------

Files:

- `dashboard/src/assets/geo/cn-provinces.json` — province paths and centroids.
- `dashboard/src/assets/geo/cn-cities.json` — prefecture lookup and map points.
- `daemon/internal/catalog/geo_data.go` — generated city index.
- `scripts/geo/build-cn-geo.mjs` and `scripts/geo/gen-daemon-geo.mjs` — the
  generators that produce the committed assets and the Go index.

Source: DataV GeoAtlas `areas_v3`, including
https://geo.datav.aliyun.com/areas_v3/bound/100000_full.json for the national
boundary and the per-province `_full.json` files for city data. The committed
`cn-provinces.json` records the source URL and the SHA-256
`99adfeded5223848bbe37a0a12f8023e11ee12161c7800521c27db42fdeac275` of the
national boundary file it was derived from.

Terms: Alibaba Cloud's DataV GeoAtlas documentation states that the data in
the tool comes from the AMAP Open Platform and is for learning and
communication purposes only; copyright questions should be directed to the
AMAP Open Platform (https://lbs.amap.com/). The DataV tool page also records
the dataset version as updated in 2021.5.

These map assets are third-party geographic data, not original code, and are
not relicensed under the MIT License. The repository uses them as a factual
geography reference for an offline map; no AMAP tiles, map imagery or API keys
are included. Anyone redistributing the repository or a built dashboard should
verify the current DataV and AMAP terms first.

